{# twig template #}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block page_title %}{{ 'Learn about Kasko Construction, LLC.' }}{% endblock %}
{% block page_meta_description %}{{ 'Learn about Kasko Construction, LLC.' }}{% endblock %}

{% block page_content %}

    {% embed 'layouts/right-sidebar.html.twig' %}

        {% block layout_header_left %}
            {% include 'components/header/logo.html.twig' %}
        {% endblock %}

        {% block layout_header_middle %}{% endblock%}

        {% block layout_header_right %}
            {% include 'components/header/call-now.html.twig' %}
        {% endblock %}

        {% block layout_page_title %}Built on Good Work and Good Relationships{% endblock %}

        {% block layout_main_content %}

            <div class="col-12">

                <p>KasKo Construction & Remodeling is a locally owned company serving homeowners throughout Middle Georgia. We handle construction, remodeling, repairs, decks, outdoor living projects, and the kind of improvements that make a home work better for the people who live there.</p>

                <p>We started KasKo with a simple idea: do good work, communicate clearly, and build a business people are comfortable calling again.</p>

                <p>We know inviting a contractor onto your property requires trust. That's why we believe in straightforward quotes, honest conversations about the work, and keeping our customers informed throughout the project. If something changes, we talk about it. If there's a better way to approach something, we'll tell you.</p>

                <p>We also believe the details matter. A project isn't finished just because the construction is complete. How we treat your property, how we communicate along the way, and how you feel about the finished work are all part of the job.</p>

                <p>We're building KasKo one project and one relationship at a time. Our goal isn't simply to finish your current project&mdash;we want to be the company you call when you're ready for the next one.</p>

                <p>Have something in mind? <a class="text-link" href="tel:1-{{ company_phone | replace({'(': '', ') ': '-'}) }}">Give us a call</a>. We'd appreciate the opportunity to take a look, talk through your options, and earn your business.</p>

            </div>

        {% endblock %}

        {% block layout_sbr %}
            {% include 'components/forms/quote-request.html.twig' %}
            <div class="w-100 mb-3"></div>
            {% include 'components/testimonials.html.twig' %}
        {% endblock %}

    {% endembed %}


{% endblock %}
